/P 476 0 R
/ActualText (This enhances the efficacy of treatment and reduces the suffering and misery experienced by non-responders. Thus, there is an immediate need to find reliable biomarkers \(i.e., genes or proteins\) that can precisely predict which patients respond best to which medications. s.)
