/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Machine learning uses pattern recognition to help diagnose, treat, and predict complications in various neurological diseases.  Acute Ischemic Stroke \(AIS\) treatment has experienced significant advancement. Machine learning algorithms are now being used to predict motor deficits in stroke patients. The most commonly used methods are Support Vector Machines \(SVM\), and 3D Conventional Neural Network \(CNN\).)
